'''Nezuko Kamado''' is a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 15.1 Update#Version 15.1.1 Update|Version 15.1.1]].

